    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d738">

                <pb facs="0704" n="606" xml:id="pg606"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Choate.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-03-08"><hi rendition="#italic">March 8,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states that shippers have been advised in accordance with Mr. Choate’s
                    cablegram of the 7th instant.</p>
                <p>Directs that British foreign office be advised that Norton &amp; Son suggest the
                    danger of long continued confinement below hatches of a shipment of oil on the
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Mashona</hi>, resulting in spontaneous combustion
                    and destruction of ship and cargo.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
